# Android compilation

- Do not compile, build, assemble, package, or run Gradle verification tasks for the Android app.
- This restriction remains active until the user explicitly says **"update version"**.
- Read-only inspection and IDE diagnostics are allowed.

# Version update

When the user says **"update version"**, follow `docs/android-version-update.md` through the end. Building the APK is not enough.

1. Set `android-app/versioning.txt` to `major.minor.MMdd` for today.
2. Build the debug APK with JDK 21 (`:app:assembleDebug`).
3. Upload `neshastyar_<version>.apk` to `/var/www/neshastyar.com/download/apk/` on the VPS.
4. Point the website download link at that file. The landing button reads `GET /api/android/latest` and must show the new `downloadUrl`. Confirm the live API response before finishing.
